# Static frontend requires no environment variables and remains a non-submitting preview.
# Runtime GET /api/config supplies only the public site key and submission mode.
# Local API: npm run db:migrate:local, then npm run dev:cloudflare.
# Official public Turnstile test keys are in wrangler.jsonc and restricted to loopback hosts.
# Real TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY and RATE_LIMIT_SALT belong only in Cloudflare secrets or ignored .dev.vars.
# Never prefix server secrets with VITE_ or put them in frontend code.
# Phase 5: public operator/contact details and policy review state are in src/config/site.ts.
# Fonts are local assets; no font-provider environment variables are needed.
# Production submission remains disabled until policies and runtime setup are reviewed.
